# Data Folders (Ignore raw, processed, and results data to avoid bloated git)
# nlp_social_listening/data/raw/*.csv
# nlp_social_listening/data/raw/*.json
# nlp_social_listening/data/processed/*.csv
# nlp_social_listening/data/results/*.csv

# Output Folders (Optional: you might want to commit figures, but usually auto-generated stuff is ignored)
# If you want to commit the generated figures/reports, comment these lines out:
# nlp_social_listening/outputs/figures/*.png
# nlp_social_listening/outputs/reports/*.md

